        rdfs:label "2005-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry.py L348–L428" ;
        dcterms:description "Lovén's Law (II, IV, I, III, V) initiation sequence and Duboc et al. (2005) Nodal L-R twin-rudiment 2D spatial simulator" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2005-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry.py#L348-L428> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry-model-fidelity-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_075_echinoderm_pentaradial_symmetry.lean L24–L192" ;
        dcterms:description "3 Lean 4 theorems proving ring m=5 selection, Lovén's Law ordering/involution, and Duboc Nodal 2x5 rudiment multiplicity" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_075_echinoderm_pentaradial_symmetry.lean#L24-L192> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Morris (2012), Mooi & David (1998), Lovén (1874), Duboc et al. (2005) & Meinhardt (2008) echinoderm bilateral-to-pentaradial hydrocoel ring symmetry breaking — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Faithfully integrates the circular-ring Gierer-Meinhardt activator-inhibitor PDE during hydrocoel crescent-to-ring closure, reproducing mode m^* = 5 (Delta_theta = 72.0 deg) selection, an equal-diffusion negative control (D_h = D_a -> 0 lobes), Lovén's Law (II, IV, I, III, V) sequential initiation and asymmetric biserial peristomial plate dominance (Ib, IIb, IIIa, IVa, Va), and Duboc et al. (2005) right-sided Nodal repression vs twin 2x5 rudiment formation. Backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_075_echinoderm_pentaradial_symmetry.lean`." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
